标准波长:
\[
\lambda_{\mathrm{std}} = \frac{\int \lambda T \, d\lambda}{\int T \, d\lambda} 
= \frac{\int_{1.1}^{1.3} \lambda \, d\lambda}{\int_{1.1}^{1.3} d\lambda} 
= 1.20\, \mu m
\]
有效波长:


\[
\lambda_{\mathrm{eff}} = \frac{\int \lambda^2 T \, d\lambda}{\int \lambda T \, d\lambda} 
= \frac{\int_{1.1}^{1.3} \lambda^2 \, d\lambda}{\int_{1.1}^{1.3} \lambda \, d\lambda} 
= 1.20\, \mu m
\]

对于标准星（瑞利-金斯近似）:
\[
\frac{f_{\lambda = \lambda_{\mathrm{std}}}}{f_{\lambda}^{\mathrm{filter}}} 
= \frac{\frac{1}{\lambda_{\mathrm{std}}^4}}{\left( \int f_{\lambda} (\lambda / hc) T \, d\lambda \big/ \int T \, d\lambda \right)(hc / \lambda_{\mathrm{std}})}
\]

\[
= \frac{1}{\lambda_{\mathrm{std}}^3} \cdot \frac{\int T \, d\lambda}{\int \lambda f_{\lambda} T \, d\lambda}
= \frac{1}{\lambda_{\mathrm{std}}^3} \cdot \frac{\int d\lambda}{\int \frac{d\lambda}{\lambda^3}}
\]

\[
= \frac{-2}{\lambda_{\mathrm{std}}^3} \cdot \left. \frac{\lambda}{\lambda^{-2}} \right|_{1.1}^{1.3} = 0.986
\]

对于目标源的光谱形状 $f_\lambda \propto\lambda^{1.3}$:
\[
\frac{f_{\lambda = \lambda_{\mathrm{std}}}}{f_{\lambda}^{\mathrm{filter}}} 
= \frac{\lambda_{\mathrm{std}}^{1.3}}{\left( \int f_{\lambda}(\lambda / hc) T \, d\lambda \big/ \int T \, d\lambda \right)(hc / \lambda_{\mathrm{std}})}
\]

\[
= \lambda_{\mathrm{std}}^{2.3} \cdot \frac{\int T \, d\lambda}{\int \lambda f_{\lambda} T \, d\lambda} 
= \lambda_{\mathrm{std}}^{2.3} \cdot \frac{\int d\lambda}{\int \lambda^{2.3} \, d\lambda}
\]

\[
= \lambda_{\mathrm{std}}^{2.3} \cdot \frac{\left. \lambda \right|_{1.1}^{1.3}}{\left. \frac{\lambda^{3.3}}{3.3} \right|_{1.1}^{1.3}} = 0.997
\]

因此标准星与目标源的差别位1.01倍，即1\%的差别。

