\[
\begin{align*}
f_T&=f_p\phi_p + f_d\phi_d=[0.025+\alpha_{f,p}(T - T_{g,p})]\phi_p+[0.025+\alpha_{f,d}(T - T_{g,d})]\phi_d\\
&=0.025+\alpha_{f,p}(T - T_{g,p})\phi_p+(T - T_{g,d})(1 - \phi_p)\alpha_{f,d}
\end{align*}
\]
设加丙二醇前后的黏度分别为$\eta_0$和$\eta_1$，根据黏度与自由体积分数的Doolittle半经验公式
\[
\begin{align*}
\ln\frac{\rho_0^3\eta_0}{\rho_0^4\eta_1}&=\frac{1}{f_p}-\frac{1}{f_T}=\frac{f_T - f_p}{f_pf_T}\\
&=\frac{(1 - \phi_p)[\alpha_{f,d}(T - T_{g,d})-\alpha_{f,p}(T - T_{g,p})]}{[0.025+\alpha_{f,p}(T - T_{g,p})][0.025+\alpha_{f,p}(T - T_{g,p})\phi_p+\alpha_{f,d}(T - T_{g,d})(1 - \phi_p)]}\\
&=7.05
\end{align*}
\]
所以$\ln\eta=\ln10^{5}-7.05 = 4.463$，$\eta = 86.74\ Pa\cdot s$。

